    <string name="btn_disable_opt">Disable Optimization</string>
    <string name="btn_autostart_settings">Autostart Settings</string>
    <string name="btn_oem_guide">View Step-by-Step %1$s Guide</string>
    <string name="socks_info_title">SSH Dynamic Forwarding (-D)</string>
    <string name="socks_info_text">Equivalent to: ssh -D %1$d %2$s\n\nApps with SOCKS5 support on this device can also use 127.0.0.1:%1$d while the tunnel is connected.</string>
    <string name="tv_info_title">Android TV Remote &amp; Always-on</string>
    <string name="tv_info_text">• Use the arrow keys to move, OK to select or toggle, Back to return to Home.\n• On Home, OK on the big button connects or disconnects.\n• Auto-Start on Boot connects your TV box right after power on.\n• Always-on: Android Settings → Network &amp; Internet → VPN → SSH Tunnel → Always-on VPN.</string>
    <string name="oem_dialog_title">%1$s Background Setup</string>
    <string name="oem_dialog_text">To keep the tunnel running in the background on %1$s:</string>
    <string name="btn_open_settings">Open Settings</string>
    <string name="oem_generic">Standard Android</string>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_xiaomi">
        <item>1. Autostart: enable the switch for this app.</item>
        <item>2. Battery saver: choose \"No restrictions\", otherwise MIUI closes the SSH tunnel after the screen locks.</item>
        <item>3. Recents: long-press the app card and tap the lock icon so the system does not clear the process.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_huawei">
        <item>1. App launch: switch management from \"Automatic\" to \"Manual\".</item>
        <item>2. Allow all three: Auto-launch, Secondary launch and Run in background.</item>
        <item>3. Lock the app in the recent tasks list.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_samsung">
        <item>1. Battery → Background usage limits: add the app to \"Never sleeping apps\".</item>
        <item>2. Turn off \"Put unused apps to sleep\".</item>
        <item>3. Turn off battery optimization for the app.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_oppo">
        <item>1. Auto-launch management: allow auto-launch for the app.</item>
        <item>2. Background battery usage: allow unrestricted background activity.</item>
        <item>3. Lock the app in the recents list.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_vivo">
        <item>1. Background power management: choose \"Allow high background power consumption\".</item>
        <item>2. Autostart: allow the app to start automatically.</item>
        <item>3. Lock the app in recents.</item>
    </string-array>
    <string-array name="oem_steps_generic">
        <item>1. Battery → Battery optimization: choose \"Don\'t optimize\" / \"Unrestricted\".</item>
        <item>2. Background data: allow unrestricted data usage.</item>
        <item>3. Always-on: in Android settings enable \"Always-on VPN\" for this app.</item>
    </string-array>

